WEBVTT

00:04:00.156 --> 00:04:04.076
Similar positive views
about ample or thick bodies

00:04:04.076 --> 00:04:07.676
have been found in ethnographic
studies across Africa,

00:04:07.676 --> 00:04:08.996
the Pacific Islands

00:04:08.996 --> 00:04:09.996
and the U.S.

00:04:10.836 --> 00:04:13.956
With increased globalization
and market reach,

00:04:13.956 --> 00:04:16.196
body ideals change over time,

00:04:16.196 --> 00:04:18.236
even in rural and remote areas.

00:04:18.836 --> 00:04:19.876
Weight stigma,

00:04:19.876 --> 00:04:22.156
or fat phobia and bias,

00:04:22.156 --> 00:04:25.956
are increasingly found
not only in the Global North,

00:04:25.956 --> 00:04:27.476
but also the Global South.

00:04:28.276 --> 00:04:30.956
With increasing obesity around the world,